  "crew": [
    {
      "name": "Iacopo De Gregorio",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::c::7580634126::vessel::d5cc4e6e-fe8c-11ed-889f-43d4bb723744::assets::caf9e790-5134-11f0-923e-df42e1c75b4b/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Italian\n\nIacopo proudly leads the yacht VITTORIA as its captain, bringing expertise and dedication to his role. With a career spanning over a decade, he has proven himself as an exceptional professional whose passion for the sea and commitment to excellence set him apart. Since beginning his yachting career in 2011, Iacopo has built a good reputation for his reliability, responsibility, and infectious enthusiasm. Iacopo’s extensive experience spans various yachts, where he consistently excelled in delivering a great service and maintaining impeccable standards. His attention to detail ensures that every aspect of the yacht operates flawlessly, creating an unparalleled experience for guests. As an expert sailor, Iacopo is especially knowledgeable about Mediterranean cruising, with a particular passion for the stunning Amalfi Coast, which he considers his favorite destination. He is fluent in English and Italian. With Captain Iacopo at the helm, guests can look forward to a truly remarkable journey."
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosario De Vincenzo",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::c::7580634126::vessel::d5cc4e6e-fe8c-11ed-889f-43d4bb723744::assets::ff019b50-5134-11f0-bf4c-23687946bfb7/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Italian\n\nRosario is a dedicated and hardworking deckhand with a strong passion for the maritime industry. His hands-on experience and deep understanding of yacht maintenance, safety procedures, and deck operations make him a valuable asset to the crew of Vittoria. With a keen eye for detail and a proactive approach, Rosario ensures that the yacht’s exterior is always in pristine condition. His adaptability and problem solving skills allow him to handle various tasks efficiently. His strong teamwork spirit, reliability, and excellent interpersonal skills make him a great support to both the crew and guests, contributing to a seamless and enjoyable experience on board. With excellent interpersonal skills, he is always ready to assist guests, providing a welcoming and professional service that enhances their time on board. Rosario fluently speaks Italian and English."
    },
    {
      "name": "Miriam Gilletti",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::c::7580634126::vessel::d5cc4e6e-fe8c-11ed-889f-43d4bb723744::assets::2e63bbd0-5135-11f0-b226-c1ecb218abd7/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Italian\n\nCheerful, organized, and passionate about hospitality, Miriam Gilletti brings warmth and precision to every charter experience. Born and raised in Sicily, she developed a deep love for the sea from an early age, inspiring her to pursue a career aboard luxury yachts. Since 2017, Miriam has been dedicated to creating unforgettable experiences for guests, ensuring every detail is perfectly attended to. Her keen eye for organization and natural ability to anticipate guests' needs make her an invaluable part of the crew. Before joining M/Y VITTORIA, Miriam worked aboard the 33-meter M/Y 55 FIFTYFIVE and the 27-meter M/Y VITTORIA. Whether setting the perfect table or adding thoughtful touches to enhance your stay, Miriam's goal is to provide a relaxing and enjoyable charter. In her free time, she enjoys swimming, trekking, and running - activities that reflect her energetic and adventurous spirit. She is fluent in both English and Italian."
    },
    {
      "name": "Angelo Adinolfi",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::c::7580634126::vessel::d5cc4e6e-fe8c-11ed-889f-43d4bb723744::assets::675dc340-5135-11f0-b4fa-3d6772ad88be/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Italian\nWith a deep passion for Mediterranean cuisine and a dedication to excellence, Chef Angelo brings a wealth of culinary expertise to M/Y VITTORIA. Born and raised in Italy, he has spent nearly a decade as the Chef Patron of Masseria Adinolfi, a renowned dining destination in the lush countryside of Sant’Angelo. From 2015 to 2024, he delighted guests with authentic flavors, seasonal ingredients, and a masterful balance of tradition and creativity. Onboard M/Y VITTORIA, Chef Angelo combines his extensive experience with a keen sense of kitchen organization, food cost optimization, and menu creation, ensuring every meal is both exceptional and perfectly tailored to guests’ preferences. Fluent in Italian and conversant in English, he creates an inviting and personalized atmosphere in the galley, ensuring that every dish reflects both his heritage and his guests' desires. With Chef Angelo at the helm of the kitchen, dining aboard M/Y VITTORIA becomes an unforgettable journey through the finest flavors of Italy and beyond. Prepare to savor every moment."
    }
  ],
